native_rich_mean is richness at a given point, averaged over the whole survey.
survey_taxa_rich and survey_native_rich are number of species in the whole lake-survey (1. all taxa, 2. just native)

secchi = secchi depth for that lake-year. Averaged over April-Sept secchi results
secchi.e = April-June secchi average

phosphorus = phosphorus for that lake-year. Averaged over April-Sept phosphorus results
phosphorus.e = April-June phosphorus average
